# EPA AQI category ramp for gdaldem color-relief.
#
# Rendered in SMOOTH mode (no -nearest_color_entry): each category colour is
# held flat across its AQI band with a 1-unit blend at each boundary, so the
# interpolated AQI surface (gdal_grid IDW) paints as smooth-edged category
# regions — the AirNow "contour" look — while the colours stay the exact EPA
# category colours the dots use. Value = AQI. Alpha 255; the app's RasterLayer
# opacity controls translucency. `nv` -> transparent outside the interpolation
# footprint (areas with no nearby monitor).
nv     0   0   0   0
0      0   228 0   255
50     0   228 0   255
51     255 255 0   255
100    255 255 0   255
101    255 126 0   255
150    255 126 0   255
151    255 0   0   255
200    255 0   0   255
201    143 63  151 255
300    143 63  151 255
301    126 0   35  255
500    126 0   35  255
